}

```

In this example, the `` @MinLength `` annotation is applied to the `` queryParameter `` parameter of the `` exampleMethod `` method. The `` (10) `` argument specifies that at least 10 characters must be present in the query parameter.

You can also use the `` @MinLength `` annotation on the method parameter to specify a minimum length of 10 characters for a POST request:


```java
